    {
      "id": "3458764590485424868",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -21603.38583352092,
      "y": -10505.301146442342,
      "width": 1700.220083182304,
      "height": 154.2857142857143,
      "text": "Para hacer encajes de piezas hay que poner que la pieza macho sea medio milimetro mas pequeña que la hembra.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fillColor": null,
      "color": "#1a1a1a",
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "3458764589913172689",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -21585.406690032207,
      "y": -8188.35253370157,
      "width": 1545.4285714285716,
      "height": 205.71428571428572,
      "text": "Medium Models\n\n\nMedium model settings will be used the most. They can be used for small to medium large prints. Add 4-8 seconds to your burn in layers.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fillColor": null,
      "color": "#1a1a1a",
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "3458764589907926837",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -21159.494770685462,
      "y": -8887.495390844428,
      "width": 1499.1428571428573,
      "height": 617.1428571428572,
      "text": "Raft \nHolds the support on a raft, like a bot. The raft is what makes contact with the build plate.\nSupport Shaft\nThe main body of the support\nSupport Tip\nThe Part of the support that makes contact with the model\nBracing\nSupport body that go between support shafts or support tips\nParenting\nBracings that are used to connect support tips to reduce the amount of Support Shafts.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fillColor": null,
      "color": "#1a1a1a",
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "3458764589907926709",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -21603.38583352092,
      "y": -9329.413778356487,
      "width": 1545.4285714285716,
      "height": 360,
      "text": "LCD\nThere are 2 main types of LCD screens. Monochrome or Mono for short and RGB.\nRGB, standing for Red Green Blue is an older printer technology and does not allow as much UV light to pass though as the light must pass though the different RGB filters. Requiring much higher print times, less detail, and shorter lifespan of the printer.Mono meaning one, is current tech that allows for more light. Results are 3x the print speed, greater accuracy and longer lifespan.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fillColor": null,
      "color": "#1a1a1a",
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "3458764589907926242",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -21603.38583352092,
      "y": -9740.842349785058,
      "width": 995.1428571428571,
      "height": 411.42857142857144,
      "text": "There are three major types of FEP\nACF - Not as accurate but high speeds may be possible.\nTextured on the bottomMilky white instead of transparent.nFEP - Best accuracy with medium to high speeds.\nAlso known as FEP 2.0 or PFA FilmFEP - Same accuracy as nFEP low speeds, mostly out of use.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fillColor": null,
      "color": "#1a1a1a",
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "3458764589600856218",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -20463.200313295005,
      "y": -11232.904176731568,
      "width": 1116,
      "height": 51.42857142857143,
      "text": "Lo mismo que lift speed pero preparandose para la siguiente layer",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fillColor": null,
      "color": "#1a1a1a",
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "3458764589600694433",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -20474.32945138527,
      "y": -11429.740938917294,
      "width": 1409.1428571428573,
      "height": 51.42857142857143,
      "text": "Estos son los milimetros que se va a levantar la build plate con la segunda velocidad",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fillColor": null,
      "color": "#1a1a1a",
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "3458764589600694293",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -20474.32945138527,
      "y": -11468.396477349857,
      "width": 1398.857142857143,
      "height": 51.42857142857143,
      "text": "Estos son los milimetros que se va a levantar la build plate con la primera velocidad",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fillColor": null,
      "color": "#1a1a1a",
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "3458764589600557319",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -20463.200313295005,
      "y": -11301.219198491011,
      "width": 1167.4285714285713,
      "height": 51.42857142857143,
      "text": "Esta es la segunda velocidad con la que se va a levantar la build plate.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fillColor": null,
      "color": "#1a1a1a",
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
      "id": "3458764589600405746",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -20463.200313295005,
      "y": -11343.674341530057,
      "width": 1146.857142857143,
      "height": 51.42857142857143,
      "text": "Esta es la primera velocidad con la que se va a levantar la build plate",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fillColor": null,
      "color": "#1a1a1a",
      "textAlign": "left"
    },
    {
